---
import H2 from '@/assets/h2-title.astro'
---
<article class="w-full flex justify-center items-center">
    <div class="relative h-160 sm:h-160 max-h-screen w-full max-w-175">
        <div class=" absolute left-1/2 top-2 md:top-8 z-20 h-120 md:h-90  w-[75%] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-sm bg-gray-100 p-4 md:p-10 shadow-xl transition-transform duration-500">
            <!-- Texto -->
            <H2>Para mis queridos invitados,</H2>
            <p class=" font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-stone-600">
                Me haría mucha ilusión que me acompañaras a celebrar mis XV años.
                Es un momento especial para mi y me encantaría compartirlo con las personas que mas quiero.
                Tu presencia haría que este día sea aún mas inolvidable.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-50 sm:bottom-64 left-1/2 z-10 h-34 sm:h-70 w-[90%] -translate-x-1/2 origin-bottom bg-[#ded2bd] shadow-md [clip-path:polygon(0_100%,50%_0,100%_100%)] sm:[clip-path:polygon(0_100%,50%_0,100%_100%)]">
            <!-- Interior de la solapa -->
            <div
                class="
                absolute inset-1.5
                bg-[#795731]
                [clip-path:polygon(0_100%,50%_0,100%_100%)]
                sm:[clip-path:polygon(0_100%,50%_0,100%_100%)]
                "
            >
            </div>
        </div>
        <div
            class="
                absolute
                bottom-0
                left-1/2
                z-30
                h-52
                sm:h-66
                w-[90%]
                -translate-x-1/2
                overflow-hidden
                rounded-b-md
                bg-[#d6c6aa]
                shadow-2xl
            "
        >
            <!-- Pliegue izquierdo -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#e3d7c2] [clip-path:polygon(0_0,55%_50%,0_100%)]"></div>
            <!-- Pliegue derecho -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#d8cab1] [clip-path:polygon(100%_0,45%_50%,100%_100%)]"></div>
            <!-- Pliegue inferior -->
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#eadfca] [clip-path:polygon(0_100%,50%_42%,100%_100%)]"></div>
            <!-- BROCHE -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-22 sm:bottom-28 left-1/2 z-40 -translate-x-1/2">
                <!-- Broche exterior -->
                <div
                    class="
                        relative
                        flex h-14 w-14
                        items-center justify-center
                        rounded-full
                        border-[3px]
                        border-[#92734c]
                        bg-linear-to-br
                        from-[#d9bd83]
                        via-[#b58c55]
                        to-[#795731]
                        shadow-lg
                    "
                >
                    <!-- Círculo interior -->
                    <div
                        class="
                        flex h-10 w-10
                        items-center justify-center
                        rounded-full
                        border
                        border-[#ead6a8]/60
                        bg-[#a77b46]
                        shadow-inner
                        "
                    >
                        <!-- Inicial -->
                        <span class="font-dancing text-xl font-bold italic text-[#f2dfb8]">D</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</article>